## Deployment Checklist

**Pre-Deployment Security Review (Required for Production)**

- [ ] **SecurityFilterChain Configuration**
  - [ ] No `permitAll()` on `/admin/**` or `/actuator/**` (except `/health`)
  - [ ] ADMIN role required for administrative endpoints
  - [ ] CSRF enabled (or justified why disabled for stateless API)

- [ ] **Actuator Endpoints**
  - [ ] Exposure limited to `health,info,metrics,prometheus` only
  - [ ] Sensitive endpoints (`env`, `heapdump`, `threaddump`) not included in exposure list
  - [ ] `show-details: when-authorized` configured for health endpoint
  - [ ] Actuator on separate port (9090) with network restrictions

- [ ] **Secrets Management**
  - [ ] Database credentials in AWS Secrets Manager (not environment variables)
  - [ ] API keys in Secrets Manager or SSM Parameter Store
  - [ ] No hardcoded secrets in code or config files
  - [ ] Secrets rotated within last 90 days

- [ ] **Authentication & Authorization**
  - [ ] JWT tokens expire within 15 minutes (or session timeout configured)
  - [ ] `@PreAuthorize` annotations on all admin methods
  - [ ] Role hierarchy correctly configured (ADMIN > USER)

- [ ] **Network Security**
  - [ ] Security group restricts port 9090 to VPC CIDR only
  - [ ] WAF rules active (rate limiting, IP reputation)
  - [ ] TLS 1.2+ enforced (no TLS 1.0/1.1)

- [ ] **Monitoring & Alerting**
  - [ ] Prometheus metrics exporter configured
  - [ ] Alert rules deployed to Alertmanager
  - [ ] PagerDuty integration tested
  - [ ] Audit logging enabled and shipping to SIEM

- [ ] **Testing**
  - [ ] All 7 security tests passing (see Test Suite above)
  - [ ] DAST scan completed (OWASP ZAP or Burp Suite)
  - [ ] SAST scan completed (Semgrep, SonarQube)
  - [ ] Dependency vulnerability scan completed (Snyk, Dependabot)

- [ ] **Documentation**
  - [ ] Security architecture diagram updated
  - [ ] Incident response playbook reviewed
  - [ ] Deployment runbook includes security verification steps

